This crate translates parts of xNVSE, the New Vegas Script Extender, into Rust (ADR-0016),
with its authors' permission (the maintainer, 2026-11-03). Source: xNVSE 6.4.9,
https://github.com/xNVSE/NVSE, commit 0ccd23a. No C++ is included.

